                  : `${corridorPlan.savingsPercent}% cheaper than solo movement on ${corridorPlan.label}. Best pickup: ${corridorPlan.pickupPoints[0]}.`}
            </div>
            {signal ? (
              <div style={{ color: DS.muted, fontSize: '0.7rem', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 8 }}>
